## Objective

Use a UNION-based SQL injection to retrieve sensitive information from another database table (`users`) and obtain the administrator credentials.

---

## Lab Scenario

The application is vulnerable to SQL injection through the product category parameter.

By exploiting the vulnerability with a UNION SELECT statement, it is possible to query the hidden `users` table and retrieve usernames and passwords stored in the database.

